            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena ni taifa lipi duniani lililo kama watu wako Israeli, ambalo Mungu alikwenda kuwakomboa kwa ajili yake mwenyewe, ili wawe watu wake, na kujifanyia jina kwa njia ya mambo makuu, yenye kuogofya, kwa kufukuza mataifa mbele ya watu wako, uliowakomboa kutoka Misri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa maana watu wako Israeli ndio uliowafanya kuwa watu wako wa milele; nawe, BWANA, umekuwa Mungu wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi sasa, Ee BWANA, neno lile ulilolinena katika habari za mtumwa wako, na katika habari za nyumba yake, na lifanywe imara milele, ukafanye kama ulivyosema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
